{"id":"W69ca56b7dc4ec9cb36e85754","zh":"统计平均值谱","en":"","name":"统计平均值谱","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W69ca56b7dc4ec9cb36e85754","text":"统计平均值谱","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S500466bc17b7ffce224c","source_id":"P106","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"在此基础上,对青藏铁路的线路几何状态及轨道不平顺谱线特征进行分析; 采用Levenberg-Marquardt 法及铁科院7 参数公式对青藏铁路轨道不平顺统计平均值谱进行公式拟合及参数提取; 结合广义极值分布函数的参数估计值,提出由轨道不平顺统计平均值谱向任意百分位谱转换的方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S39a7928249265bbcb198","source_id":"P106","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"研究结果表明: 青藏铁路轨道不平顺不同波长下的谱密度值均服从广义极值II型分布(Frechet 分布) ; 轨道高低和轨向不平顺谱线呈现复杂的窄带和周期波谱特征,其轨距不平顺状态基本处于德国高干扰谱和美国六级谱之间,应该作为重点关注的不平顺类型; 结合不同波长谱密度的概率分布规律,建议在统计平均值谱的基础上,融合尖峰谱线特征,以便提供更为合理的动力仿真激励输入谱。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P106":{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"对同一波长的谱密度样本取平均后形成的谱，是公式拟合的目标。","language":"zh","source_id":"P106","paper_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wf717c938455998542c9fabd2","name":"statistical average spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wf717c938455998542c9fabd2","name":"statistical average spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wf717c938455998542c9fabd2","name":"statistical average spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}]}